class Solution{
public:
    int addDigits(int num){
        while (num >= 10) {
            int digitSum = 0;
            int value = num;

            while (value > 0) {
                digitSum += value % 10;
                value /= 10;
            }

            num = digitSum;
        }

        return num;
    }
};
```

For `987`, the first pass gives `24`, and the next pass gives `6`.

Time complexity is O(log num), and the extra space is O(1).

